OL,3,GNEWSAFinal decision looms for new #20m
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeological surveys are due to begin
OL,7,Fat the site of a proposed #20m leisure
OL,8,Fcentre in Kent ahead of a final council
OL,9,Fdecision on the scheme.
OL,11,FPlans to replace the Angel Centre in
OL,12,FTonbridge were granted planning
OL,13,Fpermission in July, but the project
OL,14,Fstill requires ratification by
OL,15,FTonbridge and Malling Borough Council
OL,16,F(TMBC) on 20 October.
OL,18,FThe proposed facility would include an
OL,19,Fexpanded gym, spin studio, sports hall,
OL,20,Fcafe, soft play area with party space
OL,21,Fand a well-being suite.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
